            // faint. On a horizontal Roman chair with the front hip bones on the
            // pad's edge, trunk flexion-extension ran the back muscles at 37-57%
            // of maximum against 15-25% for the gluteus maximus and 12-30% for
            // the biceps femoris across three pelvis and hip set-ups (da Silva
            // et al. 2009, J Rehabil Med 41(3):136-142). For the erector version
            // the hip extensors are meant to stabilise while the erectors move
